                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "A very nice professor, who cares about what she teaches. Helpful both in and out of class, I highly recommend her History 200 class, dealing with The Ottoman Empire. There are assigned readings, and the essay/midterm can be difficult, but overall, it's worth a very interesting and kind professor.",
